# QGUARD HELIX — COMPREHENSIVE ADMINISTRATION DASHBOARD & REVENUE INTELLIGENCE AUDIT

## OBJECTIVE

Perform a comprehensive, end-to-end technical audit, validation, debugging, and remediation of the Qguard Helix Administration Dashboard, Account Settings, and Revenue Intelligence modules.

The primary objective is to ensure that every dashboard, metric, financial figure, subscription record, customer activity, payment transaction, revenue forecast, feature, tab, and action button displays accurate information derived from actual backend data and real-time system activity.

**CRITICAL REQUIREMENT: NO MOCK DATA, NO HARDCODED METRICS, NO SIMULATED REVENUE, AND NO FAKE USER ACTIVITY.**

All displayed information must originate from actual database records, authenticated user activity, verified payment transactions, subscription events, and authoritative backend services.

Do not simply review the UI. Trace the complete data flow from the database and backend services through APIs, event streams, frontend hooks, state management, and rendered components.

